      "id": 1,
      "text": "Acton's Trail Through Time overlays the town’s historic loop, offering interpretive plaques at Wheeler Lane, the Potato Cave, and the former Pencil Factory.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
