      "source": "https://www.actonhistoricalsociety.org/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Acton Center hosts an obelisk monument that commemorates town residents who died in the Revolutionary War’s Concord Fight.",
